r controversial. Moreover, they argue that censorship can be subjective and may be used by those in power to suppress dissent and manipulate public opinion. In conclusion, censorship in the arts and media is a deeply complex issue with valid arguments on both sides. While it is essential to protect individuals from harmful content, it is equally important not to curtail freedom of expression. Achieving a balance between these two conflicting principles is crucial in order to foster a society that values both creativity and social responsibility.", "encoded_message": "Restriction inside the humanities and publications has extended been a debatable problem. Whilst some claim that it is imperative to safeguard community from rude or damaging subject matter, others state that it encroaches upon liberty of exposition. Advocates of censoring proclaim that it is vital in upholding communal order and virtue. They believe that certain subject matter, such as clear pictures or aggressive scenes, should be constrained in order to safeguard susceptible people, expressly youngsters. Furthermore, they assert that suppression can thwart the dissemination of adverse convictions and publicity, hence protecting communal security. On the other respect, objectors of control argue that this quashes artistry along with bounds the trade of multifarious notions. They hold that people must possess the authority to communicate themselves liberally, even if their standpoints could be unfavored or polemical. Besides, they contend that suppression can be biased and may be used by those in power to suppress dissent and manipulate public opinion. In conclusion, censorship in the arts and media is a deeply complex issue with valid arguments on both sides. While it is essential to protect individuals from harmful content, it is equally important not to curtail freedom of expression. Achieving a balance between these two conflicting principles is crucial in order to foster a society that values both creativity and social responsibility.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 14.79, "secret_key_generation": 76.3}, "decoding_time": 0.0008471012115478516, "decoded_message": "11011100000010110000100111010010101100011101001111010111111001010011111101000001111101111101100100101010100101110100101111100000", "error_message": ""}